  PromptDialogue: Hey, I hear you've been looking for me and you want to talk about
    climate change? Well, listen up kid, climate change is just a hoax cooked up
    by the government to control us. The planet's always had hot and cold cycles.
    It's just nature doing its thing!
  correctCardName: BurningTruth
  correctCardSelected: "Alright, alright, you\u2019ve got your facts, I\u2019ll give
    you that. Maybe there\u2019s more to it than I thought."
  incorrectCardSelected: "Ha! Nice try, but you\u2019re mistaken. Those so-called
    'facts' you're quoting don't line up with what I\u2019ve researched."
